# LAMMPS Input File
# Licensed under CC BY 4.0
# See more in "A Set of Materials-Science Tutorials for the LAMMPS Simulation Package: 2. Materials Science"
# By Simon Gravelle, Mark A. Tschopp, Jacob R. Gissinger, and Axel Kohlmeyer

variable swap equal 100 # momentum swap every 100 steps (0.1 ps)
variable a0 equal 5.760

# 1) Initialization
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p

# 2) System definition
lattice diamond 5.760
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 72.63

# 3) Settings
pair_style snap
pair_coeff * * Ge_Zuo_JPCA2020.snapcoeff Ge_Zuo_JPCA2020.snapparam Ge

# 4) Monitoring
thermo 100
dump traj all atom 100 dump.lammpstrj

# 5) Run
timestep 0.001 # 1 fs
velocity all create 300.0 49284 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix mynpt all npt temp 300 300 0.1 aniso 0 0 1.0 
run 5000
